  "bodyHash": "929d232a0e64de67",
  "content": "\n\n<h4>自 FTB Chunks 1902.4.0 版本起，若您希望將 KubeJS、FTB Ranks / Luckperms、Waystones 或 Game Stages 與 FTB Chunks 整合，則必須安裝 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-xmod-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB XMod Compat</a>。</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>這是一款讓您能標記區塊以保護方塊的模組。它還內建小地圖與大地圖功能！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>在地圖任何位置按右鍵即可建立路標。</p>\n<p>對路標與死亡點按右鍵可進行編輯或刪除。</p>\n<p>點擊「已標記區塊」按鈕，然後在地圖上左鍵或右鍵點擊以選取屬於您的區塊。在已標記區塊上按住 Shift 並左鍵或右鍵點擊，可切換強制載入狀態。</p>\n<p>透過「盟友」按鈕將他人新增為盟友，允許他們與您的區塊互動。（此功能近期已變更，更新即將推出）</p>\n<p>若對方也將您新增為盟友，您們便可共享地圖資料。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;\n<img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/b1/K5sXkH.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/b1/tZp_4N.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/b1/bNT8Q9.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/b1/5W2MKd.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>保持關注最新消息</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-discord.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fgithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-github.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitter-x.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fyoutube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-youtube.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitch.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252finstagram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-instagram.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ffacebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-facebook.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftiktok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-tiktok.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
